# inference.cpp ComfyUI node estate — git IaC manifest
# One pack per line: <dir-name><TAB><git origin>
# These origins are harvested from the LIVE /opt/ComfyUI estate (verified
# remotes, 2026-08-27). bootstrap.sh clones each into infra/comfyui/nodes/
# and symlinks into $COMFYUI_ROOT/custom_nodes/, then pip-installs each
# pack's requirements into the ComfyUI venv. Idempotent: re-run skips.
#
# Lane-critical packs for the h3-timeline mega-inference:
