#
# NOT git-managed (local code, not IaC'd here): ray-*-nodes, melite-*-nodes,
# vnccs*, Nvidia_RTX_Nodes, WhatDreamsCost, ComfyUI-TRELLIS2, qweneditutils
# (duplicate of Comfyui-QwenEditUtils), LanPaint (duplicate of
# comfyui-lanpaint), websocket_image_save.py — these live in the ray/melite
# repos or are local copies, synced by ray's sync_packs.sh.
# The h3 lane needs NONE of them: H3 nodes are native to the ComfyUI fork,
# attention comes from the pip-installed comfy-kitchen.
#
# pip layer (installed into the ComfyUI venv):
